<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 25.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 25.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 25     Sept 24	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  237.970     240.800     237,040    0.91 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.020     301.070     303.640   -0.86 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.900     158.130     165.490   -4.45 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.644	46.700	48.410   -3.59 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  372.260     372.420     366.280    1.73 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.770     141.025     147.886   -4.64 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.721	15.726	14.975    4.80 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.040     218.150     230.135   -5.34 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.876	 1.879	 1.939   -3.04 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.550	 1.552	 1.575   -1.40 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  193.150     193.440     206.030   -6.02 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
